IV. THE LESSON

The algorithm’s toll booth was never about reach. It was about the feeling of reach — repeat impressions dressed as new attention, low-conviction follows dressed as growth. Cancel Premium and the vanity metrics deflate. The actual signal doesn’t.

Week 7 is the cleanest read yet: this is what organic distribution looks like when the subsidy is removed and nothing else changes. The audience that remains is the audience that was always real.

Audit recorded October 29, 2026.
